# The NuGet dependencies whose update changes what the packages ship: one exact package ID per line, compared
# without regard to case. dependabot-auto-merge.yml titles a Dependabot pull request that updates one of them
# `fix(deps):`, or `fix(deps)!:` when it crosses a major, so that the commit it is squash-merged into releases
# what it changes; every other NuGet update keeps Dependabot's `chore(deps):` and releases nothing.
# .github/scripts/shipped-dependencies-check.sh, which ci.yml runs after the pack, keeps the list true: it fails
# when a packed nuspec declares a dependency missing here, when a project under src/ references a package this
# file does not classify, either way, and when a line names something no package ships or no project references.

# Declared by a package's nuspec: referenced by a project under src/, or pinned through
# CentralPackageTransitivePinningEnabled, which makes a pinned transitive package a dependency of the package
# that pulls it in.
Dapper
FluentValidation
Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.NewtonsoftJson
Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi
Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore
Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Relational
Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions
Microsoft.Extensions.Options
Microsoft.OpenApi
Newtonsoft.Json
Serilog
Swashbuckle.AspNetCore.SwaggerGen
xunit.v3.assert
xunit.v3.extensibility.core

# Compiled into a shipped assembly, the generator or the code fix assembly AdCodicem.ValueObjects bundles beside
# it: the Roslyn API each is built against, which sets the oldest compiler, or the oldest IDE for the code fix's
# workspace layer, that loads it, and the polyfills PolySharp writes into both.
Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp
Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp.Workspaces
PolySharp

# Referenced by a project under src/ but shipping nothing, marked `!`: MinVer and Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub
# stamp the version and the source link but change no code, and Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.Analyzers only checks
# the generator's own code. An update of one of them stays chore(deps).
!MinVer
!Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub
!Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.Analyzers
